		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=16770#p16770"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>je pense que ceci devrait marcher :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT relname,COALESCE(t1.spcname,t2.spcname) AS tablespace
FROM pg_class c
LEFT JOIN pg_tablespace t1 ON c.reltablespace = t1.oid
JOIN pg_database d ON current_database() = d.datname
JOIN pg_tablespace t2 ON d.dattablespace = t2.oid
WHERE relname = &#039;nom_table&#039;;</code></pre></div><p>A peaufiner pour gérer les schémas par exemple.</p>]]></content>
